			description: ["The &6IV Circuit Assembler&r builds the quantum circuits, which the EV assembler cannot. Nanoprocessor Supercomputers, the EV line's last circuit, and the machine itself. Every quantum circuit, from the processor to the mainframe. Feed boards and chips by ME, and keep a standing stock of supercomputers."]
