			description: ["A naquadah wafer, engraved, becomes the &6SoC Wafer&r and the cutter turns it into &6SoCs&r. The IV laser engraver and a cleanroom. The quantum processor. A wafer in, chips out. Let ME feed the engraver and store the chips."]
