			dependencies: ["11004E2A89BF9FDD"]
			description: ["The &6QBit CPU Wafer&r is a CPU wafer treated with radon, and its chips go into every quantum assembly. Radon from the air line and a chemical reactor that can take it. The quantum assembly and the supercomputer. Radon by pipe, wafers by ME. Keep a spare tank of radon."]
