		{
			dependencies: ["3C9031CEC5BD66A0"]
			description: ["The &6HPIC Wafer&r carries the high-power chips that every IV energy part asks for. A large chemical reactor, or the epitaxy route if you have built it. The supercomputer and the IV hatches. Two routes, one wafer. Pick the one your cleanroom can feed and stock chips."]
