			description: ["The &6Quantum Processor&r is the quantum line's EV circuit, and it needs a SoC to exist. SoCs, and the IV assembler or the assembly line. The assembly, and every IV machine that wants circuits. Run it from the assembler's own pattern, with SoCs delivered by ME."]
