		{
			dependencies: ["380BC31148B70ADC", "3D0388842F00E792"]
			description: ["The &6Quantum Processor Computer&r is the quantum line's LuV circuit and the real wall of IV. Assemblies and HPIC chips, which means the whole wafer row behind it. The LuV machine hull, and the mainframe after it. Stock every input in the network first. This recipe is the one that stalls."]
